## 10. Conclusion

This specification provides a deterministic, high-performance, and complete architectural design for the Milestone 4 View Controllers and Dynamic DOM Rendering on LG webOS TVs. It fully respects the 10-foot television ergonomics, hardware memory limits, spatial navigation contracts, and reverse-engineered endpoints of `cinejoy.pk`.
